recommend keep-going the stereo modulation class holds the amplitude pair (tremolo, ring modulator); the next Lindy rungs carry the delay-line modulations (chorus, vibrato, flanger — each channel keeping its own delay-line snapshot, the harder crux) or the auto_pan
